---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL, PRIVACY_EMAIL, SAFETY_EMAIL } from '../lib/site'
---

<Base
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with Bondfires. Email the founders directly, report a safety concern, manage your data, or delete your account."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
      <h1>Talk to a person.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Bondfires is run by the two people who built it. Every message below lands in an inbox one of
        us reads.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-2 cards">
        <a class="card link" href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>
          <h3>Something isn’t working</h3>
          <p class="muted">Bugs, billing, a camp you can’t get into, a video that won’t upload.</p>
          <span class="addr">{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card link" href={`mailto:${SAFETY_EMAIL}`}>
          <h3>Report a safety concern</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            Use the report button on any video first, which reaches us immediately. For anything involving
            a child, email us directly as well. Reviewed same day.
          </p>
          <span class="addr">{SAFETY_EMAIL}</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card link" href={`mailto:${PRIVACY_EMAIL}`}>
          <h3>Your data</h3>
          <p class="muted">Requests to access, export, or correct your data. See the <span class="u">privacy policy</span> for what we hold.</p>
          <span class="addr">{PRIVACY_EMAIL}</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card link" href="/delete-account">
          <h3>Delete your account</h3>
          <p class="muted">Step-by-step instructions, and what happens to your videos and data afterwards.</p>
          <span class="addr">bondfires.org/delete-account</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Before you email</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Most “how does this work” questions are answered in the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>.</li>
          <li>Uploads that seem stuck usually finish when the app is reopened on Wi-Fi. Recordings are saved locally until they do.</li>
          <li>Subscription changes and refunds go through the App Store or Google Play, not through us. We can help you find the right screen.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Response times</h2>
        <p>
          Child-safety reports are reviewed the same day. Other reports within 72 hours. Everything else,
          usually within two business days. We’re small; if something is urgent, say so in the subject line.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 860px;
  }
  .cards {
    margin: var(--space-7) 0;
  }
  .link {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    align-content: start;
    color: var(--smoke);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .link:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
    border-color: var(--copper);
  }
  .link h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .link p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .u {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .addr {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
